# Force LF on checkout for all text files. Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true)
# rewrites docker/ollama-entrypoint.sh to CRLF, and /bin/sh in the Ollama container then fails with
# "set: Illegal option". Shell scripts MUST stay LF regardless of host OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
